    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"This bibliography contains about 1400 references to aid studies on the geology and resources of the Tertiary Green River Formation.  Most references are on the areal geology, stratigraphy, paleontology, geochemistry, and mineralogy but other references are on oil shale development and include recent studies about the effects of an oil shale industry on the environment. \"",
